### Test Authentication Endpoints

### 1. Get Available Roles
GET https://localhost:7001/api/auth/roles
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Register a new user (Admin)
POST https://localhost:7001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test Admin",
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "phone": "1234567890",
  "roleId": "admin-role-id-here",
  "password": "TestPass123"
}

###

### 3. Register a new user (Inspector)
POST https://localhost:7001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Test Inspector",
  "email": "inspector@test.com",
  "phone": "0987654321",
  "roleId": "inspector-role-id-here",
  "password": "TestPass123"
}

###

### 4. Login with valid credentials
POST https://localhost:7001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "TestPass123"
}

###

### 5. Login with invalid email
POST https://localhost:7001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nonexistent@test.com",
  "password": "TestPass123"
}

###

### 6. Login with invalid password
POST https://localhost:7001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "password": "WrongPassword"
}

###

### 7. Register with existing email (should fail)
POST https://localhost:7001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Another User",
  "email": "admin@test.com",
  "phone": "1111111111",
  "roleId": "inspector-role-id-here",
  "password": "TestPass123"
}

###

### 8. Register with weak password (should fail)
POST https://localhost:7001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Weak Password User",
  "email": "weak@test.com",
  "phone": "2222222222",
  "roleId": "inspector-role-id-here",
  "password": "weak"
}

###

### 9. Register with invalid email format (should fail)
POST https://localhost:7001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Invalid Email User",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "phone": "3333333333",
  "roleId": "inspector-role-id-here",
  "password": "TestPass123"
}

###

### 10. Login with empty fields (should fail)
POST https://localhost:7001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}
